            <ArticleTitle>The effect of music therapy on patients' perception and manifestation of pain, anxiety, and patient satisfaction.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>7-14; quiz 15</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An extensive review and synthesis of current research was completed to identify the clinical benefit of using music therapy in the hospital setting. It demonstrated that music therapy has the potential to improve the hospital experience of patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
